---
const ORDER_URL = "https://rajubhaidabeliwale.com/onlineorder/";
---
<section class="hero" id="home">
  <div class="container hero-grid">
    <div>
      <div data-reveal="1">
        <span class="eyebrow">Nashik · Est. 1987</span>
        <h1>Rajubhai <em>Dabeliwale</em></h1>
        <p>Rajesh Gokuldas Jobanputra started Rajubhai Dabeliwale in Nashik back in 1987. What began with the best authentic Kutchi Dabeli has grown into 30+ Dabeli variations and Kathiyawadi Fafda — one recipe, three decades, no compromise.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-actions" data-reveal="2">
        <a href={ORDER_URL} class="btn btn-primary" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Order Now<svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></a>
        <a href="#menu" class="btn btn-outline">See The Menu</a>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-strip" data-reveal="3">
        <div><strong>1987</strong><span>Established</span></div>
        <div><strong>30+</strong><span>Dabeli Varieties</span></div>
        <div><strong>4.8</strong><span>Customer Rating</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-visual" data-reveal="4">
      <div class="frame-card" data-parallax="0.06">
        <div class="frame">
          <svg class="steam" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9 2c-1 1.5.5 2-.5 3.5S8 8 9 9"/><path d="M13 1c-1 1.5.5 2-.5 3.5S12 7 13 8"/></svg>
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-dabeli"/></svg>
          <svg class="chili-accent" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-leaf"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="frame-caption">Signature Kutchi Dabeli</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
